// HZM coop - MP HOST RULES (host-wide match rules). MP-OWNED menu (coop_mp* name, matched by MP_MANIFEST
// glob ui/coop_mp*.urc), so it may name the MP host cvars coop_mpBotFill / coop_mpBotMax / coop_mpHardcore /
// coop_mpNoAds / coop_mpNoProne / coop_mpNoCover / coop_mpNo3p and the engine MP server cvar sv_maxbots.
// Pushed from ui/coop_mpmenu.urc (hostRulesBtn) via `pushmenu coop_mphostrules`. Loaded automatically by the
// engine ui/*.urc sweep (cl_ui.cpp CL_InitializeUI), so no coop file registers it. INERT in coop: never
// pushed there, and its controls only set coop_mp* / sv_* cvars.
//
// Hand-authored (this file is NOT generated - it has no gen_menu_fieldsettings.py table); the two praised
// Field Settings sheets (coop_hostrules.urc, coop_settings.urc) ARE generated, so this one copies their look
// by hand: manila folder + printed sheet, facfont-20 headers over 1px rules, ON/OFF plate + lamp toggle rows,
// a slider with end caps, greyed INDENT_BORDER "(soon)" placeholder tiles.
//
// WIRING:
//   BOT AUTO-FILL - coop_mpBotFill is the desired TOTAL playing count the engine bots backfill toward
//     (mp_bots.scr::bots_tick: desiredBots = clamp(coop_mpBotFill - humans, 0, cap)); 0 = Off. The slider
//     writes it live (0..12, step 1). sv_maxbots is CVAR_LATCH and is BOTH the bot-slot ceiling AND the
//     Recast-nav gate (bug-2617): if it is 0 when an MP map loads, "No bots, skipping navigation" fires and
//     NO bot can ever spawn on that map. So the slider alone is not enough - the ARM BOT SLOTS button does
//     `set sv_maxbots 12`, which the host presses once BEFORE starting the first map. That is the sanctioned
//     "Apply on this sheet" that pairs the latch with the fill target. coop_mpBotMax (cap, default 12) is
//     left at its default here.
//   HARDCORE - coop_mpHardcore 0/1, a plain checkbox (the row toggle is a transparent CheckBox over an
//     ON/OFF plate + lamp, exactly like coop_hostrules).
//   REALISM TOGGLES - coop_mpNoAds / coop_mpNoProne / coop_mpNoCover / coop_mpNo3p, each 0/1. Same row style
//     as Hardcore: a transparent CheckBox linkcvar'd to the coop_mpNo* cvar over an ON/OFF plate + lamp. The
//     plate shows the FEATURE state (ON = the mechanic is available), so the ON lamp is enabledcvar'd on the
//     NEGATION (!coop_mpNo*): default (cvar unset = 0) reads ON = today's behaviour, checking the row turns
//     the mechanic OFF = classic. mp_realism.scr composes the four into the serverinfo bitmask g_mpRealismOff.
//   DOWN BUT NOT OUT / MEDKITS - coop_mpDbno / coop_mpMedkits, each 0/1. Positive-polarity toggle rows
//     (ON = the system is enabled), same plate+lamp+transparent-CheckBox style as Hardcore, laid out as
//     two half-width rows on one line (the space the old "(soon)" tiles occupied). DBNO ports coop DBNO
//     into coop_mod/mp_dbno.scr; Medkits ports the coop self-heal into coop_mod/mp_medkits.scr.
// No vstr anywhere (isolation clause 18: the MP UI is client-origin, a server-stuffed vstr is filtered);
// plain `set` / linkcvar only. This file names ONLY coop_mp* host cvars + sv_maxbots - never a coop_* gameplay
// cvar, never coop_lo* / ui/loadout / a coop_mod path, never a coop menu.
//
// URC conventions: each resource field on its own line (single-line blocks silently drop); colour fills for
// panels, never raw-image shaders (bug-menu-shader-label-invisible); canvas stays 640x480 (bug-1365); ASCII,
// no em-dash. Declaration order is draw + hit order: chrome, headers, labels, plates, lamps, footer, Sliders,
// CheckBoxes, Buttons - so each row toggle's transparent CheckBox sits on top of its plate and lamp.
menu "coop_mphostrules" 640 480 NONE 1
borderstyle NONE
bgcolor 0 0 0 0
align centerx centery
virtualres 1
fullscreen 0

direction from_top 0

